							"code" : "| url zipFile destination contents |\nurl := 'https://scg.unibe.ch/download/merino/review-vissoft/dataset-utf8.zip'.\nzipFile := FileLocator imageDirectory / 'dataset-utf8.zip'.\ndestination := FileLocator imageDirectory / 'dataset-utf8'.\ndestination ensureCreateDirectory.\ncontents := ZnClient new get: url.\nzipFile binaryWriteStreamDo: [ :stream | stream nextPutAll: contents ].\nZipArchive extractFrom: zipFile to: destination.\n{ zipFile fullName. zipFile size. destination fullName. (destination children collect: #basename) asArray }"
