										"paragraphStyle" : {
											"__type" : "textStyle"
										},
										"string" : "Downloaded the 48,968-byte archive and extracted it under:\n\n`/Users/oscar/Desktop/GT/GT-2026-08-25@18h45/dataset-utf8/dataset-utf8/`\n\nIt contains two UTF-8 CSV datasets:\n\n- **`dataset-review-vissoft-all.csv`** — 346 bibliographic records (99,262 bytes), spanning **2002–2015**. It includes title, author positions, venue, type, description, location, date, pages, and BibTeX-related fields. Most frequent types: **N/A (73)**, **Design Study (65)**, **Technique (65)**, and **System (60)**.\n- **`dataset-review-vissoft-selected.csv`** — 65 selected records (81,509 bytes) with richer review annotations: paper metadata plus goal, audience, task, representation, medium, platform, source/license availability, and research category. The largest task groups are **Programming (19)**, **Maintenance (13)**, **Reverse Engineering (13, including one capitalization variant)**, and **Debugging (11)**. Common categories include **History (10)**, **ND (9)**, **TE (9)**, and **Debugging (7)**.\n\nThe selected set concentrates in 2003–2015, with 2010 and 2015 contributing 10 papers each. The archive also contains an extraneous `__MACOSX` directory."
									}
								]
